span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼk">Style: </span><span>{</span><span class="ͼm">vibe</span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼk">Notes: </span><span>{</span><span class="ͼm">notes</span><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼk">Please determine:</span><br><br><span class="ͼk">1. Whether they should stay only on Oahu or visit multiple islands.</span><br><span class="ͼk">2. The ideal number of days before and after the wedding.</span><br><span class="ͼk">3. The best island combination.</span><br><span class="ͼk">4. The best flight sequence between islands.</span><br><span class="ͼk">5. A detailed day-by-day itinerary.</span><br><span class="ͼk">6. Romantic activities.</span><br><span class="ͼk">7. Great restaurants.</span><br><span class="ͼk">8. Hidden gems.</span><br><span class="ͼk">9. Budget estimates.</span><br><span class="ͼk">10. Packing recommendations.</span><br><br><span class="ͼk">If multiple islands are recommended, explain WHY and provide a realistic schedule.</span><br><br><span class="ͼk">Optimize for maximizing vacation enjoyment while minimizing unnecessary travel time.</span><br><span class="ͼk">"""</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1547" data-end="1668">This is actually better than making the wedding dates user-entered because your trip is centered around a specific event.</p>
<p data-start="1670" data-end="1713">The AI will start answering questions like:</p>
<ul data-start="1715" data-end="2002">
<li data-section-id="1hqnchb" data-start="1715" data-end="1832">
<p data-start="1717" data-end="1832">"You should arrive Oct 4, spend 3 days on Kauai, fly to Oahu for the wedding, then spend 4 days on Maui afterward."</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15pus00" data-start="1833" data-end="1928">
<p data-start="1835" data-end="1928">"For a 9-day trip, stay entirely on Oahu because the wedding already breaks up the schedule."</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="10hw4ex" data-start="1929" data-end="2002">
<p data-start="1931" data-end="2002">"For a 14-day trip, Kauai → Oahu (wedding) → Maui is the best balance."</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2004" data-end="2096" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">That's much closer to a real vacation-planning assistant than a generic itinerary generator.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-27273b9b.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Share" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-27273b9b.svg#630ca2" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><span class="" data-state="closed"><button type="button" id="radix-_r_n3_" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-st