ds whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="97">Yes, that makes perfect sense, and I would actually change the prompt to reflect it more clearly.</p>
<p data-start="99" data-end="118">The trip is really:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1efvrdr" data-start="120" data-end="133">Stephanie</h3>
<ul data-start="134" data-end="206">
