</li>
<li data-section-id="1828aqg" data-start="411" data-end="467">
<p data-start="414" data-end="467">How many days before the wedding to arrive in Hawaii.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1cewf5q" data-start="468" data-end="511">
<p data-start="471" data-end="511">How many days after the wedding to stay.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9a0cxz" data-start="512" data-end="559">
<p data-start="515" data-end="559">Which islands make sense around the wedding.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1fhyjzt" data-start="560" data-end="602">
